# Choose one source for portfolio content builds (resume and case studies).
# Local sibling checkout; reads committed resume.md and portfolio/work/*.md
# from the configured vault branch. Uncommitted edits are not published.
# RESUME_VAULT_DIR=../Zeus-Vault

# Hosted build; this existing token also reads case studies. Store it as a
# repository secret with Contents: read access
# to the private Zeus-Vault repository. Do not commit a token here.
# RESUME_CONTENT_TOKEN=
